  "question": {
    "text": "Three identical balls are connected by light inextensible strings with each other as shown and placed over a smooth horizontal table. Length of each string is <math><mi>l</mi></math> .<br />\rAt moment <math><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> , ball B is imparted a velocity <math><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math> perpendicular to the string and then the system is left on its own. The speed of A at the instant just before it collides with C is\r\r<p>&nbsp;</p>\r<img alt=\"\" height=\"68\" src=\"assets\\qt0089_f255a7293a9f.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" width=\"152\" />"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Using conservation of linear momentum along the initial direction of motion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>The total kinetic energy of the system will remain&nbsp;the same<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is the component of velocity of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>&nbsp;perpendicular to the initial direction of motion of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math><msubsup><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Velocity of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math></p>"
  }
